01:16:54,960 --> 01:16:59,520
The figure on the left shows what is

1998
01:16:56,719 --> 01:17:01,679
recorded in k space.

1999
01:16:59,520 --> 01:17:04,239
Remember the forier transform is a

2000
01:17:01,679 --> 01:17:06,800
complex function. It has both amplitude

2001
01:17:04,239 --> 01:17:09,199
and phase. But what we display here is

