01:21:07,199 --> 01:21:11,520
This 3D rendering gives us a cutaway

2108
01:21:09,360 --> 01:21:13,520
view of how an MRI scanner is structured

2109
01:21:11,520 --> 01:21:15,520
and how a patient fits inside the

2110
01:21:13,520 --> 01:21:17,760
system. At the center, you see the

2111
01:21:15,520 --> 01:21:20,320
patient lying on the patient table which

2112
