2113
01:21:20,320 --> 01:21:24,400
Surrounding the patient are several key

2114
01:21:22,400 --> 01:21:26,080
components.

2115
01:21:24,400 --> 01:21:28,239
Closest to the body are the radio

2116
01:21:26,080 --> 01:21:30,080
frequency coils. These coils are

2117
01:21:28,239 --> 01:21:32,080
responsible for transmitting the RF

2118
01:21:30,080 --> 01:21:34,080
