2264
01:26:52,719 --> 01:26:56,320
These scanners are critical in

2265
01:26:54,320 --> 01:26:58,400
biomedical research because they allow

2266
01:26:56,320 --> 01:26:59,840
scientists to study disease models,

2267
01:26:58,400 --> 01:27:02,239
monitor treatment effects, and

2268
01:26:59,840 --> 01:27:04,320
investigate basic biological processes

2269
01:27:02,239 --> 01:27:06,239
in a controlled setting before moving to

2270
01:27:04,320 --> 01:27:08,400
human trials.

