2358
01:30:22,080 --> 01:30:25,840
be contained and stabilized to prevent

2359
01:30:24,159 --> 01:30:28,800
interference with surrounding equipment

2360
01:30:25,840 --> 01:30:30,880
and to protect patient safety.

2361
01:30:28,800 --> 01:30:32,960
In addition to the MRI magnet, the

2362
01:30:30,880 --> 01:30:36,159
