Although not shown in this illustration,

2365
01:30:37,840 --> 01:30:42,080
the CBCT would provide complimentary

2366
01:30:40,080 --> 01:30:43,840
X-ray imaging, making this a hybrid

2367
01:30:42,080 --> 01:30:46,159
system that combines MRI's excellent

2368
01:30:43,840 --> 01:30:48,639
soft tissue contrast with CT's accuracy

2369
01:30:46,159 --> 01:30:50,639
for dose calculation.

2370
01:30:48,639 --> 01:30:53,679
Clearly, this figure illustrates an

2371
01:30:50,639 --> 01:30:56,800
innovative idea in radiation oncology. A

2372
01:30:53,679 --> 01:30:59,280
split magnet MRI system integrated into

2373
01:30:56,800 --> 01:31:01,199
a rotating gantry designed to guide

2374
01:30:59,280 --> 01:31:04,000
precise radiation treatment while

2375
01:31:01,199 --> 01:31:07,000
maintaining realtime MRI imaging of the

2376
01:31:04,000 --> 01:31:07,000
