01:32:27,120 --> 01:32:31,280
the order of the T1 and T2 relaxation

2412
01:32:29,600 --> 01:32:32,800
times.

2413
01:32:31,280 --> 01:32:35,520
For example, you might write something

2414
01:32:32,800 --> 01:32:38,159
like T1 of brain is greater than T1 of

2415
01:32:35,520 --> 01:32:40,800
CSF, which is greater than T1 of aquous

2416
01:32:38,159 --> 01:32:42,639
humor. The goal here is to compare how

