01:32:40,800 --> 01:32:44,320
different tissues relax under different

2418
01:32:42,639 --> 01:32:46,400
frequencies.

2419
01:32:44,320 --> 01:32:48,880
In problem 4.8, you are working with

2420
01:32:46,400 --> 01:32:51,280
hydrogen nuclei in fat and water. You

2421
01:32:48,880 --> 01:32:53,199
are told that the T2 value of fat is 100

2422
01:32:51,280 --> 01:32:55,920
milliseconds and the T2 value of water

