01:32:55,920 --> 01:33:00,800
In a spin echo experiment, you need to

2425
01:32:58,320 --> 01:33:03,840
calculate the delay time between the 90°

2426
01:33:00,800 --> 01:33:06,000
pulse and the 180° pulse that maximizes

